## Language and scope

Kickoff-generated project records are written in English. Follow the project's
approved localization requirements for product copy and user-facing content.
Do not translate or otherwise rewrite unrelated files merely because a task
touches their area.

When documentation or code disagrees, resolve it within the current task when
that correction is in scope. Otherwise record the conflict as follow-up work.
Do not make unrelated “on sight” changes.

