## Backlog CLI boundaries

- Use the CLI for tasks, drafts, documents and milestones; never hand-edit their
  Markdown files.
- A decision body is the sole direct-edit exception: run
  `backlog decision create`, then fill Context, Decision and Consequences in the
  generated decision file because the CLI has no content-update command.
- `backlog task edit` cannot target a task under `.backlog/completed/`. Do not
  move completed task files by hand during normal work; report a correction that
  requires archival maintenance.
- Changing a task title does not rename its file. Treat the filename as stable
  Backlog metadata rather than renaming it by hand.

